      </eAnnotations>
      <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3199&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>Stereotype for classes with a temporal validity. The scale attribute defines the scale of this validity, in the insurance industry most temporal domain objects have the scale DAY.&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
    </ownedComment>
