      </eAnnotations>
      <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3199&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>An aggregate is a special form of an entity with is exposed to other parts of the domain. Usualy aggregates could be called root objects.&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
    </ownedComment>
